"f":["IMPF","(X)","3MP"],"r":66,"l":297,"g":[["يَسْتَكْبِرُ","V","stem","IMPF|(X)|3MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"i":"7:206:7","a":"عَنْ","t":"from","p":"P","tr":"ʿan","l":21},{"i":"7:206:8","a":"عِبَادَتِهِۦ","t":"His worship","p":"N","tr":"ʿibādatihi","f":["F","GEN"],"r":32,"l":884,"g":[["عِبَادَتِ","N","stem","F|GEN"],["هِۦ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MS"]]},{"i":"7:206:9","a":"وَيُسَبِّحُونَهُۥ","t":"And they glorify Him","p":"V","tr":"wayusabbiḥūnahu","f":["IMPF","(II)","3MP"],"r":122,"l":276,"g":[["وَ","REM","prefix","w:REM"],["يُسَبِّحُ","V","stem","IMPF|(II)|3MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"],["هُۥ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MS"]]},{"i":"7:206:10","a":"وَلَهُۥ","t":"and to Him","p":"PRON","tr":"walahu","f":["3MS"],"l":16,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["لَ","P","prefix","l:P"],["هُۥ","PRON","stem","3MS"]]},{"i":"7:206:11","a":"يَسْجُدُونَ ۩","t":"they prostrate","p":"V","tr":"yasjudūna","f":["IMPF","3MP"],"r":123,"l":334,"g":[["يَسْجُدُ","V","stem","IMPF|3MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"e":"٢٠٦","v":"7:206"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"7:196","t":"Indeed, my protector is Allāh, who has sent down the Book; and He is an ally to the righteous.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":196,"sd":null},{"k":"7:197","t":"And those you call upon besides Him are unable to help you, nor can they help themselves.\"","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":197,"sd":null},{"k":"7:198","t":"And if you invite them to guidance, they do not hear; and you see them looking at you while they do not see.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":198,"sd":null},{"k":"7:199","t":"Take what is given freely, enjoin what is good, and turn away from the ignorant.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":199,"sd":null},{"k":"7:200","t":"And if an evil suggestion comes to you from Satan, then seek refuge in Allāh. Indeed, He is Hearing and Knowing.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":200,"sd":null},{"k":"7:201","t":"Indeed, those who fear Allāh - when an impulse touches them from Satan, they remember [Him] and at once they have insight.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":201,"sd":null},{"k":"7:202","t":"But their brothers - they [i.e., the devils] increase them in error; then they do not stop short.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":202,"sd":null},{"k":"7:203","t":"And when you, [O Muḥammad], do not bring them a sign [i.e., miracle], they say, \"Why have you not contrived it?\" Say, \"I only follow what is revealed to me from my Lord. This [Qur’ān] is enlightenment from your Lord and guidance and mercy for a people who believe.\"","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":203,"sd":null},{"k":"7:204","t":"So when the Qur’ān is recited, then listen to it and pay attention that you may receive mercy.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":204,"sd":null},{"k":"7:205","t":"And remember your Lord within yourself in humility and in fear without being apparent in speech - in the mornings and the evenings. And do not be among the heedless.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":205,"sd":null},{"k":"7:206","t":"Indeed, those who are near your Lord [i.e., the angels] are not prevented by arrogance from His worship, and they exalt Him, and to Him they prostrate.","j":9,"h":18,"s":7,"a":206,"sd":1}],"juz":9,"hizb":18,"surahs":[7],"sajdah":true}